{"4939540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FreeStyle 2 Classic: Street Basketball", "steam_appid": 4939540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4939540/extras/7db7ff8acedaef083c8220f9aeacb802.avif?t=1786522949\" width=920 height=430 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong>A Fresh Start. A Classic Experience.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FreeStyle2 Classic - where everyone starts again on equal footing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The familiar fun you love returns with a fresh Classic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rediscover the true essence of FreeStyle2, where skill, teamwork, and basketball IQ decide the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FreeStyle2 Classic brings back the authentic street basketball experience that players have loved for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>The Pure Essence of Basketball</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Makes the Difference</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is earned through teamwork, smart decisions, and individual skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Court</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning, timing, teamwork, and basketball IQ are the keys to winning every match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Competitive Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the original <strong>FreeStyle2 Classic</strong> gameplay that rewards dedication, mastery, and teamwork.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Express Your Unique Playstyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character comes with unique attributes, signature skills, and distinct playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with a wide variety of skills, Freestyle moves, and outfits to match your<br> preferred way of playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the perfect combination and create a playstyle that's truly your own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Joy of Playing Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street basketball is built on teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends, take on stronger opponents, and compete together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create or join a <strong>Crew</strong>, climb the rankings, and prove your teamwork against players from around the world.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4939540/extras/7db7ff8acedaef083c8220f9aeacb802.avif?t=1786522949\" width=920 height=430 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong>A Fresh Start. A Classic Experience.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FreeStyle2 Classic - where everyone starts again on equal footing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The familiar fun you love returns with a fresh Classic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rediscover the true essence of FreeStyle2, where skill, teamwork, and basketball IQ decide the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FreeStyle2 Classic brings back the authentic street basketball experience that players have loved for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>The Pure Essence of Basketball</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Makes the Difference</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is earned through teamwork, smart decisions, and individual skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Court</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning, timing, teamwork, and basketball IQ are the keys to winning every match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Competitive Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the original <strong>FreeStyle2 Classic</strong> gameplay that rewards dedication, mastery, and teamwork.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Express Your Unique Playstyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character comes with unique attributes, signature skills, and distinct playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with a wide variety of skills, Freestyle moves, and outfits to match your<br> preferred way of playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the perfect combination and create a playstyle that's truly your own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Joy of Playing Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street basketball is built on teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends, take on stronger opponents, and compete together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create or join a <strong>Crew</strong>, climb the rankings, and prove your teamwork against players from around the world.</p>", "short_description": "FreeStyle2 Classic: Street Basketball is a fast-paced 3-on-3 street basketball game. Choose your favorite character, customize your skills and Freestyle moves, and create a playstyle that's uniquely yours. On the court, only skill, teamwork, and strategy determine victory.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4939540/31ac8020cbf8f3b680cfc381b337641d358e83cf/header.jpg?t=1786522949", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4939540/aa4c2b126f920034a75e46f5a5ab9a62d8843305/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786522949", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4939540/aa4c2b126f920034a75e46f5a5ab9a62d8843305/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786522949", "website": null, "pc_requir